// Waders' cairn (save point) on the Pale Rim: the last big cairn before the Choir. Nobody's shrine; it answers in every state.
title: ch16_shrine_pale_rim
location: ch16/pale_rim
---
A cairn taller than Kerrid, white with salt. The waders say whoever reaches it may rest here. Every stone was carried out by someone who meant to walk home again. #line:ch16_shrine_001 #narration #long
===
